  "confidence": "derived",
  "derivation": "Ordered by ProductKey the prices are 100, 20, 10, 50. Bike has no previous row: 100. Helmet: 100 + 20 = 120. Lock: 20 + 10 = 30. Scooter: 10 + 50 = 60.",
